<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-ignore-folders">
    <title>Ignore folders</title>
    <body>
    <p>To ignore a folder, first go to <uicontrol
        conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/>
      <b>></b>
      <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/>.<ul
        id="ol_vtn_kzw_jjc">
        <li>Right-click a folder to open the contextual menu and select <uicontrol
            conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>
          <b>></b>
          <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ign-dir-0-ignore-dir"
          />.</li>
        <li>Alternatively, select the arrow next to a folder to expand it. Right-click any file in
          the folder to open its contextual menu and select <uicontrol
            conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>
          <b>></b>
          <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore-parent-dir"
          />.</li>
      </ul></p>
    <p>The untracked folder is added to the project's <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>.</p>
  </body>
</topic>